ong>not <\/strong>be charged any additional customs duties or import fees upon delivery. Should any unexpected charges arise, Kern Leather will cover them in full. The price you pay at checkout is the final price — no surprises.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_A6nTqH":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What is your return policy?","answer":"<p>Under the Consumer Contracts Regulations 2013, you have the right to cancel your order within <strong>14 calendar days <\/strong>of receiving your goods, without giving any reason. At Kern Leather, we operate a <strong>hassle-free, no-return policy<\/strong>— meaning you do not need to send the product back to us. Simply contact us and we will arrange a resolution. For full details, please visit our <a href=\"\/pages\/return-refund-policy\" title=\"Return Refund Policy\">Return & Refund Policy <\/a>page.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_chwA9p":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"Can I track my order?","answer":"<p>Yes! Once your order has been dispatched, you will receive a tracking number via email. You can use this number on our Track Your Order page to follow the progress of your delivery in real time.<\/p>"}},"faq_item_qfyJFV":{"type":"faq_item","settings":{"question":"What type of leather do your products use?","answer":"<p>Our products are crafted from high-quality <strong>genuine leather<\/strong>. We are committed to offering <strong>100% authentic products<\/strong>. We work with genuine leather of the highest quality.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["faq_item_fCWjAX","faq_item_LeF7Vj","faq_item_A6nTqH","faq_item_chwA9p","faq_item_qfyJFV"],"name":"Home FAQ","settings":{"top_tag":"QUESTIONS & ANSWERS","title":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","description":"Check out the answers to the most common questions about our products and deliveries.","show_contact":true,"phone":"+44 7427 860092","email":"support@kernleather.com","show_view_all":true,"view_all_text":"Looking for more information? Check out our complete FAQ page for all the details.","vi